      "id": "text-8000024",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 70,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "roundness": null,
      "text": "sw_angle = m_steering_angle \u00b7 kSteerRatio      R alone (identity C) = the original spin (release unchanged).\nC = mat4_cast(m_steer_axis_correction): a full REST orientation of the wheel about the pivot \u2014 visible at ANY\nsteer angle \u2014 so yaw/pitch/roll/quaternion (debug UI) can straighten a tilted/misaligned wheel. Identity C = no-op.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    }
